          </table>

          <div class="callout">
            <strong>Statistical Finding:</strong> On this holdout, observed <code>Precision@K</code> between Frequency Business and Logistic Regression is quite close.
            The paired customer bootstrap 95% confidence interval (2,000 replicates) <strong>contains 0 across all three budget levels (10%, 20%, 30%)</strong>, meaning a difference in precision between the two methods is not proven.
